    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124157",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOGBERRY.\nIs our whole dissembly appeared?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124157/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124157/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 42,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4479238,
        "end": 4479310,
        "line": 166007,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@124157",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOGBERRY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124233",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VERGES.\nO! a stool and a cushion for the sexton.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124233/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124233/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 48,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4479314,
        "end": 4479392,
        "line": 166012,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@124233",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VERGES.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124315",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SEXTON.\nWhich be the malefactors?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124315/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124315/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 33,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4479396,
        "end": 4479459,
        "line": 166017,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@124315",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SEXTON.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124382",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOGBERRY.\nMarry, that am I and my partner.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124382/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124382/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 42,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4479463,
        "end": 4479535,
        "line": 166022,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@124382",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOGBERRY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124458",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VERGES.\nNay, that’s certain: we have the exhibition to examine.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124458/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124458/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 63,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4479539,
        "end": 4479632,
        "line": 166027,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@124458",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VERGES.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124555",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SEXTON.\nBut which are the offenders that are to be examined? let them come before Master Constable.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124555/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124555/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 99,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4479636,
        "end": 4479766,
        "line": 166032,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@124555",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SEXTON.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124689",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOGBERRY.\nYea, marry, let them come before me. What is your name, friend?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124689/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124689/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 73,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4479770,
        "end": 4479873,
        "line": 166038,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@124689",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOGBERRY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124796",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BORACHIO.\nBorachio.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124796/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124796/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 19,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4479877,
        "end": 4479926,
        "line": 166043,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@124796",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BORACHIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124849",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOGBERRY.\nPray write down Borachio. Yours, sirrah?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124849/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124849/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 50,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4479930,
        "end": 4480010,
        "line": 166048,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@124849",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOGBERRY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124933",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CONRADE.\nI am a gentleman, sir, and my name is Conrade.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124933/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@124933/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 55,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4480014,
        "end": 4480099,
        "line": 166053,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@124933",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CONRADE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125022",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOGBERRY.\nWrite down Master gentleman Conrade. Masters, do you serve God?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125022/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125022/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 73,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4480103,
        "end": 4480206,
        "line": 166058,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@125022",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOGBERRY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125129",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BOTH.\nYea, sir, we hope.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125129/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125129/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 24,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4480210,
        "end": 4480264,
        "line": 166063,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@125129",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BOTH.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125187",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOGBERRY.\nWrite down that they hope they serve God: and write God first; for God defend but God should go before such villains! Masters, it is proved already that you are little better than false knaves, and it will go near to be thought so shortly. How answer you for yourselves?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125187/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125187/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 280,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4480268,
        "end": 4480581,
        "line": 166068,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@125187",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOGBERRY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125504",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CONRADE.\nMarry, sir, we say we are none.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125504/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125504/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 40,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4480585,
        "end": 4480655,
        "line": 166076,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@125504",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CONRADE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125578",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOGBERRY.\nA marvellous witty fellow, I assure you; but I will go about with him. Come you hither, sirrah; a word in your ear: sir, I say to you, it is thought you are false knaves.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125578/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125578/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 180,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4480659,
        "end": 4480871,
        "line": 166081,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@125578",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOGBERRY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125794",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BORACHIO.\nSir, I say to you we are none.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125794/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125794/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 40,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4480875,
        "end": 4480945,
        "line": 166088,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@125794",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BORACHIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125868",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOGBERRY.\nWell, stand aside. Fore God, they are both in a tale. Have you writ down, that they are none?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125868/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@125868/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 103,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4480949,
        "end": 4481083,
        "line": 166093,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@125868",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOGBERRY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@126006",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SEXTON.\nMaster Constable, you go not the way to examine: you must call forth the watch that are their accusers.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@126006/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
