      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOGBERRY.\nYea, marry, that’s the eftest way. Let the watch come forth. Masters, I charge you, in the Prince’s name, accuse these men.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
