      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SECOND WATCH.\nMarry, that he had received a thousand ducats of Don John for accusing the Lady Hero wrongfully.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneIV_25.2/p@126820/line-1",
