      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOGBERRY.\nGod’s my life! where’s the sexton? let him write down the Prince’s officer coxcomb. Come, bind them. Thou naughty varlet!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
